# 2/2 Flitterwing Nuisance attacks Bot2 and the Elvish Mystic attacks Bot2's Liliana of the Veil (loyalty 3): two
# creatures, a player and a planeswalker, two cards. Hand: 1 after turn 1, 2 after the turn-3 draw, then +2 = 4.

